---
description: Markdown filenames must be ALL CAPS
globs: "**/*.md"
alwaysApply: true
---

# ALL CAPS Markdown Filenames

- Every `.md` file basename must be ALL CAPS.
- Keep the extension as `.md` (lowercase).
- Examples: `SPEC.md`, `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`
- Bad: `spec.md`, `Spec.md`, `Readme.md`
- When creating or renaming markdown files, use the ALL CAPS form.
- If you find a non-ALL-CAPS `.md` filename, rename it to match this rule.
